 - Replaced `Options::hold` with `Options::drain_on_exit` that drains, but doesn't hold, since holding can be done outside of alacritty_terminal
 
+### Fixed
+
+- Cursor not moving to the origin when setting or resetting origin mode (DECOM)
+- Origin mode not being saved and restored with the cursor (DECSC/DECRC)
+
